# This repo publishes to stevevierraag.com via Cloudflare Pages.
# Anything committed here becomes PUBLICLY READABLE at a guessable URL.
#
# The repo root doubles as a working folder holding tax forms, LLC filings,
# and signed agreements. So the rule is inverted: ignore everything by
# default, then allow site files back in one at a time. New files are
# invisible to git until deliberately allowed — it fails closed.
#
# Adding a new page or image? Add an explicit `!` line for it below.

*

# This file must exempt itself — `*` above matches it too.
!.gitignore

# --- Pages ---
!index.html
!privacy.html

# --- Assets ---
!style.css
!script.js
!favicon.svg

# --- Search / crawlers ---
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml

# --- Logos & brand marks ---
!logo.png
!logo2.png
!logo.webp
!logo.jpeg
!logo.pdf
!logo-transparent.png
!logo-transparent1.png
!logo-transparent2.png
!A3af40cc91c1e439e808d615778998e14D.webp
!Untitled design.png

# --- Photography (images/ only, by extension) ---
!images/
!images/*.jpg
!images/*.JPG
!images/*.jpeg
!images/*.JPEG
!images/*.png
!images/*.PNG
!images/*.webp

# --- Never commit, even if allowed above ---
# .DS_Store leaks the filenames of everything else in the folder,
# including the documents this file exists to keep out.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local tooling / editor state
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Secrets — belt and braces; the `*` above already covers these
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
